title: 'pallet-preimage: add try_state invariant checks'

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Adds a `try_state` hook to `pallet-preimage` (issue #239) that asserts the status maps and the stored preimages stay consistent: every status recording a noted preimage has its bytes present in `PreimageFor` at the same length, every stored preimage has a matching status, and no hash appears in both the deprecated `StatusFor` and `RequestStatusFor`. The checks run under the `try-runtime` feature, and also after every unit test. The change is additive with no migration or weight changes.

crates:
- name: pallet-preimage
  bump: minor
